        "created_at": "2015-06-17T11:18:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I've been 100% addicted to the incredible SotM: Video Game lately. My favourite thing to do is click \"random\", cut down to 3 heroes, and see how many times it takes me to win. So far it's been 4 or 5 times at most...until the current match I've run into.</p><p>In this order: Absolute Zero, The Visionary and Tempest, going up against Plague Rat in the Ruins of Atlantis. I've played it about 20-25 times now and I can't even get PR below 50 health. Is there a strategy I'm missing, or is this combination just genuinely impossible?</p><p>Help me out, it's driving me mad! (after my 25th straight loss, I decided to play a different random game: I got Haka, Tempest and Ra...against Plague Rat in the Ruins of Atlantis. I died just as quickly as I did with the other team. Help!)</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
