        "created_at": "2015-06-17T11:21:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Visionary could throw Twist the Ether on the Rat (and Absolute Zero if need be), then hide in a Cucoon. Also, once Tempy is incapped, he can help mitigate the damage the other heroes take.</p>",
