        "id": 142758,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-06-17T13:11:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That is a hard matchup, putting twist on AZ and cocooning Vis helps (esp if you can wrest a kraken or mystic weaponry), I always let him flip then destroy infections. &nbsp;Tempest you want Shackles as fast as possible.</p><p>The game is a damage race, so things like Wrest on a Kraken (3 to vis and 5 to rat is a win) and stratosphering a non-infection ongoing, or even suggestion can really make a difference in buying you another round of life.</p><p>Just don't get sucked into downpour, extending the game lets rat cycle his best cards.</p>",
