        "created_at": "2015-06-17T15:30:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Woo hoo! Thanks guys! Twist on Plague Rat, turning all his attacks into whatever Tempest was protecting from = easy win! Appreciate your help!</p>",
