        "raw": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"Http://i.imgur.com/dj9NeqQ.jpg\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Woo hoo! Thanks guys! Twist on Plague Rat, turning all his attacks into whatever Tempest was protecting from = easy win! Appreciate your help!</p>",
